@startuml Компонентная диаграмма - Notification Service
title Notification Service - внутренние компоненты

package "Notification Service" {
  [Message Handler] as msg_handler
  [Notification Logic] as logic
  [Email Sender] as email_sender
  [Push Sender] as push_sender
}

queue "Message Broker" as mq
node "Почтовый сервис" as email_ext
node "Push уведомления" as push_ext

mq --> msg_handler : consume event
msg_handler --> logic : handle
logic --> email_sender : send
logic --> push_sender : send
email_sender --> email_ext : API/SMTP
push_sender --> push_ext : API

note right of msg_handler
  Слушает очереди:
  notifications.email
  user.subscription.expired
end note

note left of logic
  Определяет тип уведомления
  Выбирает шаблон
  Маршрутизирует
end note

@enduml